1. Registry URL Conventions
JFrog Artifactory — single source for all images. No direct internet pulls.

Custom CI images (built on bastion, pushed to JFrog local repo):
  artifactory.jfrog.sbi:443/itepaypg-sbiepay2-docker-local/custom-ci/<name>:<version>

Red Hat images — registry.access.redhat.com (proxied via JFrog remote repo):
  artifactory.jfrog.sbi:443/itepaypg-sbiepay2-docker-virtual/ubi9/<image>:<tag>
  artifactory.jfrog.sbi:443/itepaypg-sbiepay2-docker-virtual/hi/<image>:<tag>

Red Hat images — registry.redhat.io (subscription required, proxied via JFrog):
  artifactory.jfrog.sbi:443/itepaypg-sbiepay2-docker-virtual/rhtas/<image>:<tag>
  artifactory.jfrog.sbi:443/itepaypg-sbiepay2-docker-virtual/advanced-cluster-security/<image>:<tag>

GitLab security-products (proxied from registry.gitlab.com via JFrog remote repo):
  artifactory.jfrog.sbi:443/itepaypg-sbiepay2-docker-virtual/ubi9/security-products/<name>:<tag>

JFrog virtual repo (itepaypg-sbiepay2-docker-virtual) must proxy:
  registry.access.redhat.com  — UBI images, hi/git, ubi9/podman (no subscription)
  registry.redhat.io          — cosign (RHTAS), roxctl (RHACS) — needs RHN credentials
  registry.gitlab.com         — GitLab security-products images
